{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Oh, hello. Are you here about the job, Ma'am?": "",
  "Yes. I'm Noriko Taguchi. You came highly recommended by Genda-sensei.": "",
  "I'm Yagami. Sorry to have kept you waiting. Here, I'll get the door.": "",
  "So yeah, I'm a private investigator. You wanted me to investigate if your husband is cheating on you or not, correct?": "",
  "Yes, I'm afraid that's right.": "",
  "I can't shake the feeling that he might be, but I need someone to find out for sure.": "",
  "Very well. Can you tell me the whole story?": "",
  "Yes... You see, my husband and I own a café on Taihei Boulevard called \"Heavy Coffee.\"": "",
  "We've managed it together ever since it opened, in fact.": "",
  "My husband's a good man, but he's always kept to himself.": "",
  "We've been married 40 years, and I can hardly remember any real fights, let alone infidelity...": "",
  "Sounds like you two have a great marriage.": "",
  "I would usually agree, but lately he's been leaving the café early.": "",
  "I mean, there have always been slow days, where he would leave to hit the pachinko slots or go see a movie.": "",
  "But lately this has become an almost everyday occurrence.": "",
  "But what leads you to believe he's cheating on you?": "",
  "Perhaps he's simply found a new hobby, for instance. That's fairly common at your age, isn't it?": "",
  "Yes, I thought that might be the case at first, too.": "",
  "But one day I stopped in at the pachinko parlor he said he'd be at...": "",
  "And I didn't see him anywhere.": "",
  "And you're sure you were at the right place? This city has quite a few pachinko parlors.": "",
  "If it had only been once... I might not be so sure.": "",
  "But I assure you, I've been thorough. I've checked in several times now.": "",
  "And I've never found him there once.": "",
  "I see... It sounds like you've done your homework then. Sorry for giving you the third degree, there.": "",
  "Yagami-san, I'd like you to investigate where my husband goes when he leaves the shop.": "",
  "And if he is cheating, can you tell me who he's meeting?": "",
  "You really want the gory details?": "",
  "Yes. I want to know what kind of woman he would cheat on me with.": "",
  "I can do that, but I have to say, sometimes you're better off not knowing. You're sure?": "",
  "Yes, I'm sure. I put 80,000 yen on my request... Is that sufficient?": "",
  "Of course. I'll take the case.": "",
  "Like I said, he leaves the café early almost every day now.": "",
  "He even told me that he's been wanting to see a new movie that just came out.": "",
  "All right. That should make it simple enough to tail him when he leaves.": "",
  "Please do.": "",
  "(The lady's shop is called \"Heavy Coffee\" and it's on Taihei Boulevard. Guess I'll check it out.)": "",
  "(This is Heavy Coffee...)": "",
  "(Hm?)": "",
  "(That must be my client's husband. Let's see where he goes.)": "",
  "(Well, this isn't the way to the movie theater... Where's he headed?)": "",
  "(A woman! Not looking positive...)": "",
  "(She's caked in make-up, though. Must be really trying to hide her age.)": "",
  "(They're moving!)": "",
  "(Going into a love hotel together... This is pretty damning evidence.)": "",
  "(But I'll need a picture to prove it.)": "",
  "(That should be good enough... The husband's face isn't in focus, but this is clearly solid evidence.)": "",
  "(Now to figure out who he's seeing. Guess I'll wait 'til they come out of the hotel.)": "",
  "(...Finally. Not bad for your age, you two...)": "",
  "(Looks like they're splitting up here. Time to follow the woman.)": "",
  "(Wait... This is...)": "",
  "(We're back at Heavy Coffee. What the hell?)": "",
  "(Could it be...)": "",
  "(Guess it doesn't matter. The pictures should be enough for the client.)": "",
  "Hello, Noriko-san?": "",
  "Yagami-san? Have you found anything out?": "",
  "Yes, I'd like to go over my findings. Would you mind stopping by the office?": "",
  "Of course. I'll be right there.": "",
  "See you soon, then.": "",
  "(All right, I'll meet her back the office.)": "",
  "...Based on this evidence, I think it's safe to say with almost full certainty that your husband is cheating. I'm sorry.": "",
  "I-I'm sorry. Was there more, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Yes. Regarding the woman your husband was seeing... Does she look familiar?": "",
  "Th-That's...!": "",
  "Am I correct in assuming she's the owner of Kasho Zoku, the bar above Heavy Coffee?": "",
  "Yes, you're absolutely right. We've met a few times, actually.": "",
  "I... I had no idea he was seeing someone so close. I'm a fool to have not seen it earlier...": "",
  "Don't blame yourself. In a trusting relationship, you aren't really looking for those kinds of signs.": "",
  "Like I said, sometimes these kinds of details are best left undiscovered...": "",
  "But your husband is seeing your neighbor, that much is true.": "",
  "And now the truth is a weapon in your hand. Just be careful about how you wield it, okay?": "",
  "...Thank you, Yagami-san. I'm actually relieved to know it.": "",
  "I think... I'll file for divorce.": "",
  "I'm glad, though. I'm glad to know, rather than spend the rest of my life as an ignorant clod.": "",
  "Thank you for being so thorough.": "",
  "Just doing my job. If you need anything else, don't hesitate to get in touch.": "",
  "Ha. No thank you. I don't need to feel what I'm feeling now ever again.": "",
  "(This one ended up right where it started... Sometimes it really is darkest under the lamp post.)": "",
  "The Red Brick again, maybe?": "",
  "That works.": "",
  "(The Red Brick, huh? That's gotta be the Red Brick Hotel...)": "",
  "(All right, I'm going to need a photo as proof. Where's the best spot to catch them entering the hotel?)": "",
  "(Here?)": "",
  "(Or here?)": "",
  "(No, maybe here...?)": "",
  "(I should follow them and then get into a position that'll give me a clean shot.)": "",
  "(Hard to call this evidence of infidelity... Hm? ...Shit, they're coming this way!)": "",
  "(Damn, I couldn't get a photo!)": "",
  "(All right! Couldn't ask for a better photo than this. Perfect.)": "",
  "(Oops, that's the wrong way. I need to get evidence...)": "",
  "(Crap, my phone's full. I have to delete some pictures or something.)": "",
  "(Nope, still out of space.)": "",
  "(I need more space to take a shot. I gotta tone it down on the pics, I guess.)": "",
  "(All right, that should do the trick.)": "",
  "Hey there, sport. Mind if I ask you a couple questions?": "",
  "Huh? Sure, why not.": "",
  "Are you one of the millions dissatisfied with poor or unusual batting performance? The name's Hatano, by the way.": "",
  "Now, I develop sports equipment all across Japan and I know a real slugger when I see one. What's your name, champ?": "",
  "I'm Yagami.": "",
  "I'll get straight to the point, Yagami-san. I've seen you step up to bat several times now, and I always think...": "",
  "\"<font_kind=yakuza_italic>Wow</font_kind>! This rookie's got himself a <font_kind=yakuza_italic>pretty powerful swing</font_kind>.\"": "",
  "Oh, most definitely. I find myself saying, \"<font_kind=yakuza_italic>Man</font_kind>, this guy is good! If only he knew how to pick the right <font_kind=yakuza_italic>equipment</font_kind>!\"": "",
  "Is that right...": "",
  "So, how about this? I will give you... the <font_kind=yakuza_italic>incredible</font_kind> opportunity... to test out our <font_kind=yakuza_italic>all-new batting gloves</font_kind>!": "",
  "Batting gloves?": "",
  "Not just any batting gloves, either! They'll beef up your swing, improve your grip, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>and</font_kind> keep your hands blister-free!": "",
  "It's as easy as 1-2-3! You'll be helping me gather valuable product data, too. So don't be shy, give 'em a try!": "",
  "How about it, Yagami-san? Are you <font_kind=yakuza_italic>on the ball</font_kind> with this one?": "",
  "...I guess?": "",
  "Then they're yours! For the very low price of 3,000 yen.": "",
  "Wait, now you're asking for money!?": "",
  "Of course! You give and you get, live and learn! There's no such thing as a free lunch! Surely you know the deal by now.": "",
  "(Hmm... Do I really wanna spend 3,000 yen, though...)": "",
  "Fantastic! ...But I'm afraid this isn't enough to cover it.": "",
  "Oh, my bad. I'll be right back.": "",
  "No worries, I'll still be here.": "",
  "Fantastic! You'll be swinging for the fences in no time!": "",
  "And any time I have a new product, I'll bring it here with me!": "",
  "Okay. Then I guess I'll see you around.": "",
  "Hmm, no thanks. Maybe next time.": "",
  "Gotcha. Well, if you ever change your mind, you know who to talk to.": "",
  "Fancy some top-notch batting gloves for the incredibly low price of 3,000 yen?": "",
  "How are those batting gloves treating you, Yagami-san?": "",
  "They're not so bad.": "",
  "I see... At least that's an honest answer.": "",
  "But you won't have such a lackluster response once you feast your eyes on the wonder I brought you <font_kind=yakuza_italic>today</font_kind>!": "",
  "Heh, someone's excited.": "",
  "Why wouldn't I be? After all, we just finished developing the legendary... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>the ultimate</font_kind>... Golden Bat!": "",
  "Hmm. What's so special about it?": "",
  "Glad you asked! It's coated with extra-strength duralumin to <font_kind=yakuza_italic>really</font_kind> make those balls go flying!": "",
  "Okay. And how's the grip on that thing?": "",
  "Well! After many a trial and error, we finally discovered the <font_kind=yakuza_italic>absolute perfect shape</font_kind> that'll fit anyone and everyone's hands!": "",
  "Go for the gold, Yagami-san! <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Get into the swing of things</font_kind> and try it for yourself!": "",
  "But aren't these things expensive?": "",
  "Sure, maybe if you went with <font_kind=yakuza_italic>the other guys</font_kind>. But I'll offer you a <font_kind=yakuza_italic>huge discount</font_kind> and <font_kind=yakuza_italic>free delivery</font_kind>! All for only 30,000 yen!": "",
  "That... actually is expensive!": "",
  "Don't worry, your money won't go to waste! Everyone who's ordered this bad boy says they could never imagine batting without it!": "",
  "(30,000 yen for a Golden Bat...)": "",
  "Excellent choice, my friend! ...But I'm afraid you don't have enough.": "",
  "Trust me, nothing knocks it out the park or keeps you safer in the dark than a trusty Golden Bat! You're gonna love it!": "",
  "Well... It all started when I came down with a horrible illness and had to go on medical leave...": "",
  "I gotta ask, though. Why sell all this stuff yourself?": "",
  "Ever since then, I haven't been feeling like my normal self. So I've been hanging out at the batting cages to get some inspiration.": "",
  "Still interested in the Golden Bat for the incredibly low price of 30,000 yen?": "",
  "I mean, you said you were the developer, right? Why not have someone else do it?": "",
  "Oh boy, here we go.": "",
  "But when I saw you batting... Something inside me changed. My brain started firing on all cylinders once more!": "",
  "So I hurried back home, threw open my closet, and finished all the prototype equipment I was tinkering with before!": "",
  "And here you are selling it to me. Well, you do make some pretty quality stuff.": "",
  "I'm glad you find it useful.": "",
  "If it weren't for you, I might still be lost among these cages like a forgotten foul ball, never to return to the field.": "",
  "No sweat, Hatano-san. If you ever develop any new equipment, definitely let me know.": "",
  "Haha. I'm not quite sure when that will be, but I guess we'll just have to see.": "",
  "See you around, sport.": "",
  "Mm... No thanks. Maybe next time.": "",
  "(There's something up there...)": "",
  "(Is that... a person? Kinda hard to tell from down here... Time to let the pigeon spread its wings.)": "",
  "(Aha! I knew that was a person.)": "",
  "(But... why's he dressed up like a <font_kind=yakuza_italic>ninja</font_kind>?)": "",
  "So, you have discovered me at laaaaaaaaast!": "",
  "Oh man... That guy just ate shit! Maybe I should check on him.": "",
  "...How impressive. For no one has seen past my Chameleon Camouflage and lived to tell the tale!": "",
  "Alas, forgive my rudeness. I am known as Ryan Acosta, the number one ninja beneath the rising sun... Believe it!": "",
  "Allow me to ask thy name.": "",
  "...Yagami.": "",
  "Then I shall call you Master Yagami. A fitting title for a man of such high caliber!": "",
  "However... this will not happen a next time. Believe it!": "",
  "And now, I take my leave. Farewell!": "",
  "(...What the hell was that?)": "",
  "...Aaaaand Ryan appears from the shadows! *ahem* Well done, Master Yagami. Your shurikens are quite something to behold.": "",
  "Oh look, it's Ryan. Oh nooo...": "",
  "Whenever I see such skillful dartistry, I get overwhelmed by memories of training back in my homeland...": "",
  "Mastering the shuriken is essential to the ninja arts, you see. I once honed this skill with my comrades every day...": "",
  "Alas, shurikens were difficult to procure in the States, so I often would practice using darts.": "",
  "Wait, there's a ninja school in the United States?": "",
  "Indeed. It is an authentic Japanese dojo run by an authentic Japanese person.": "",
  "I'm not sure what part of that sentence makes your school actually authentic... But hey, what do I know.": "",
  "It all boils down to this, Master Yagami: I wish to challenge you to a one-on-one duel of darts!": "",
  "You wanna play darts, huh...": "",
  "Ah. 'Twould be dishonorable of me to interfere with your profession. After you're prepared, let us have our duel.": "",
  "Sorry, but I'm in the middle of work.": "",
  "Ah, 'tis Master Yagami. Will you accept my challenge?": "",
  "Sure. I'll play along.": "",
  "...As expected of the man—no, the <font_kind=yakuza_italic>samurai</font_kind>—whom I hold in high regard!": "",
  "So all you want is to play a game of darts?": "",
  "Oh, this is more than a simple game... It is a fateful match that will decide the course of history! Believe it!": "",
  "Fwa ha ha! I remain undefeated!": "",
  "Wow. This is a new low for me.": "",
  "'Tis as I surmised. Come challenge me again when you've polished up your skills!": "",
  "(This is completely pointless... Yet somehow I can't stand losing to this guy.)": "",
  "Ah, Master Yagami! I see you wish to duel with me once more?": "",
  "Then I accept your challenge! Hope you've improved.": "",
  "Oh, I don't plan on losing this time.": "",
  "Wh... What sorcery is this!? I actually <font_kind=yakuza_italic>lost</font_kind> at <font_kind=yakuza_italic>shuriken</font_kind>?": "",
  "You mean darts.": "",
  "Now... I <font_kind=yakuza_italic>don't</font_kind> believe it!": "",
  "You see... I was undefeated in shuriken back at the academy...": "",
  "Am I still lacking in something? More rigorous training, perhaps?": "",
  "I suppose I shall take my leave once again. Farewell, Master!": "",
  "(...This guy hurts my ears.)": "",
  "Gah! What the hell, man!?": "",
  "Huh? You're the one that bumped into me.": "",
  "Agh, my shoulder's totally busted... Bet some apology money would fix me right up!": "",
  "Yeah right. You're nothing but a scam artist, and a crappy one at that.": "",
  "You saying my pain ain't shit to you? Then what I gotta do to make you understand? Pound it through your skull?": "",
  "Try it and see what happens.": "",
  "Hey boys, we got ourselves a wiseass here! Go show this fucker what happens when he doesn't pay his dues!": "",
  "Pucker up, asshole!": "",
  "Son of a bitch... This guy's insane!": "",
  "Don't let me see you around here again.": "",
  "M-My boys... We're outta here, man!": "",
  "And stay out.": "",
  "That fierce style... Those fancy moves... Master Yagami, what you did just now was nothing short of incredible!": "",
  "Oh, Ryan. You were watching the whole time?": "",
  "Feh, so you've finally noticed? I'm a bit disappointed it took you so long. Then again, I am a ninja who lives in the shadows.": "",
  "But I will concede this! Every time we've tested our wits and mettle, I've held back out of consideration.": "",
  "Think of it as a series of training exercises, if you will. And I admit, you are quite skilled. But all that ends now!": "",
  "I propose to you a final test of strength... Let us revel in a bout of martial arts! What say you? Are you... ninja enough?": "",
  "I-I see. Then I shall respect that.": "",
  "If I go through with this, will you be done with all your ninja anime bullshit?": "",
  "Never! ...But I guess I could dial it down a bit, at least around you. You have earned my ninja respect.": "",
  "Fu fu fu, that's my line!": "",
  "I... I failed...": "",
  "Why... Why can I not defeat you!?": "",
  "If only I had used my Dark Doppelganger Delusion! It would've been two against one!": "",
  "Or I could've used my Substitution Clones to draw away your attacks...": "",
  "Blast... Now I'm all out of chakra energy! You leave me no other choice... Here goes!": "",
  "Master Yagami, I beg of you! Take me under your wing as your ninja apprentice! <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Onegai shimasu</font_kind>!": "",
  "Teach me how to be the ultimate ninja warrior! I'll call you \"Master\" till the day I perish from this world!": "",
  "That... would be disturbing. And besides, I'm not even a ninja.": "",
  "It matters not!": "",
  "It might not matter to you, but it sure as hell does to me...": "",
  "Well... I didn't hear a no, so I guess we're set to go!": "",
  "From now until the sun sets permanently on this beautiful land, I swear to vanquish all enemies of the Yagami Clan!": "",
  "*sigh* Well, I guess I wouldn't mind a helping hand every now and then...": "",
  "(But do I really want a guy who thinks he's a ninja following me around...?)": "",
  "That made for some excellent training! I shall appear again whenever you need it, Master Yagami! Ninja out!": "",
  "(Hope that's not for a while...)": "",
  "Have you come to accept my challenge, Master Yagami?": "",
  "All right. Then I'll teach you what a real fight is.": "",
  "Now then... Let this be a showdown for the ages!": "",
  "Oho?": "",
  "Alright! There's Murase! Heh, not bad, Tak.": "",
  "(First thing's first. Gotta get past reception.)": "",
  "(It's dark... I need to turn on the lights before\nI can look for the blueprints for the building.)": "",
  "(Either way, the key from before won't work up here.)": "",
  "(No way I'm getting in there without the code.)": "",
  "(I'll investigate a bit more.)": "",
  "(Murase was on a higher floor.)": "",
  "(Talking with Murase comes first.)": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Please do.": "เชิญเลย",
  "(Hm?)": "(หืม?)",
  "Is that right...": "งั้นเหรอ...",
  "Oho?": "โอโฮ?"
 }
}
